        "selector": {
          "type": "FragmentSelector",
          "value": "xywh=pixel:18.362924575805664,12.279829025268555,45.85227012634277,23.96306800842285",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>A good supplement.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The peace of God the exalted and his mercy and blessings,&nbsp;and his most abundant greetings&mdash;with these we greet</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>his noble excellency Sayyidi Muh\u0323ammad H\u0323asan, may God strengthen him. Amen.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>After offering copious greetings to him&mdash;It is not hidden from you that before this date</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>we sent to inform you that you should take from Mu\u02bfallim</p>\n<p>Shim\u02bfu\u0304n Fransi\u0304s</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>12,000 fid\u0323d\u0323a and 5,800 fid\u0323d\u0323a</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>in large silver quru\u0304sh, but this was an error. What is correct</p>\n<p>is that you should take</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>from the aforementioned [i.e., Shim\u02bfu\u0304n Fransi\u0304s] the 12,000</p>\n<p>fid\u0323d\u0323a and give him the deposit belonging to him</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>and that the 5,800 large silver quru\u0304sh</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>is in the deposit belonging to us, in which there are 100 bunduqi\u0304s and 100</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>fara\u0304nsa. May you be informed of this [lit., &lsquo;may that be in your honourable knowledge&rsquo;]. And peace.</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
